ified minus refuted), deterministically - not from vibes or LLM judgment. 3 free calls/day, then entitlement 'ledger'.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"receipts":{"type":"array","description":"List of receipt objects, each with an 'ok' boolean and optional 'score'."}},"required":["receipts"]},"effect":{"effect":"read","hash":"14468ebe5191c9aaf0d3a83bd0ef5770dd9d868dfb35533516c80432533e253d"}},{"name":"detect_contradiction","description":"[Ledger product, entitlement: ledger] Detect contradictions across structured claims: the same key asserted with conflicting values flips RED, otherwise GREEN. Deterministic and recomputable. Use agents_contradiction instead when comparing free-text agent prose. 3 free calls/day, then entitlement 'ledger'.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"claims":{"type":"array","description":"List of claim objects, each with a 'key' (or 'subject') and a 'value'."}},"required":["claims"]},"effect":{"effect":"read","hash":"05249adc231bd182f4bd047b95d5ccb6da2e755b042b50865870f04f674dd79f"}},{"name":"enforce_sla","description":"[Ledger product, entitlement: ledger] Enforce an SLA/obligation by recomputation: the obligation is met only if the work verifies GREEN against its claimed digest. 3 free calls/day, then entitlement 'ledger'.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"inputs":{"type":"object","description":"The work payload to verify."},"claimed_digest":{"type":"string","description":"Claimed digest the obligation is conditioned on."},"obligation":{"type":"string","description":"Human-readable obligation label."}},"required":["inputs"]},"effect":{"effect":"write","hash":"98056f0a7db79fcdd8e28a70264848cdcc77719bc97f409d3e5901ffc387dd22"}},{"name":"route_capability","description":"[Ledger product, entitlement: ledger] Route a natural-language intent to a deterministic capability/pipeline coordinate. 3 free calls/day, then entitlement 'ledger'.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"intent":{"type":"string","description":"The natural-language intent to route."}},"required":["intent"]},"effect":{"effect":"read","hash":"569beb3abf99db97493b9f146a48bb1047c8943cc3b27e56497e26b40fdfc4e3"}},{"name":"render_polyglot_roundtrip_pure","description":"[Fuse product · entitlement: fuse · FREE_R2_DEMO] Syntax-as-Data polyglot render head: source -> language-neutral logic IR -> source in target language. Canonical demo examples baked to R2 (4 examples × 12 languages). Live emit of novel inputs via the SDK.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"source_text":{"type":"string","description":""},"atom_name":{"type":"string","description":""},"language":{"type":"string","description":""}},"required":["source_text","atom_name"]},"effect":{"effect":"read","hash":"4707e232aea123211a700e9bf90fb4aff4365cccc818f3b63e44074b29d2c0c4"}},{"name":"render_polyglot_all_pure","description":"[Fuse product · entitlement: fuse · FREE_R2_DEMO] Polyglot emit to all 7 supported targets in one call. Returns {ok, ir, results, languages}. Canonical demo examples baked to R2; novel inputs via SDK.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"source_text":{"type":"string","description":""},"atom_name":{"type":"string","description":""}},"required":["source_text","atom_name"]},"effect":{"effect":"read","hash":"cab7a5a275bafe4158d2d35904eb0dfe936051c99da366a448e873c1e4acb4ee"}}]}
